---
title: AllocationPlanVersion State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Calculated : planner produces batch slices + shelf-life prices for the SO
    Calculated --> Committed : conditional reservation update succeeds (auto, no Admin approval)
    Calculated --> Superseded : version conflict, a re-planned version replaces this one
    Calculated --> Discarded : shortage or technical error, attempt rolled back
    Committed --> [*]
    Superseded --> [*]
    Discarded --> [*]
